# Environment Variables Template

# Supabase Configuration
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=your-project-url.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here

# Google OAuth (Sign in with Google)
# ----------------------------------
# These are consumed by Supabase Auth, NOT by the frontend. Do NOT prefix them with VITE_ —
# Vite bundles every VITE_ variable into the client-side JS, which would leak the client secret
# to anyone viewing the page source.
#
# - Hosted Supabase project: do not set these here at all. Configure them in
#   Supabase Dashboard -> Authentication -> Providers -> Google instead.
# - Local dev via `supabase start`: the two vars below are read by supabase/config.toml
#   ([auth.external.google]) and must be set in your shell or a git-ignored .env used by the CLI.
SUPABASE_AUTH_EXTERNAL_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
SUPABASE_AUTH_EXTERNAL_GOOGLE_SECRET=

# Edge Function secrets (email: send-asset-email + AMC reminders)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------
# These are consumed by Deno edge functions (supabase/functions/*), not the
# frontend, so they must NOT be prefixed with VITE_. Set them on the hosted
# project with `supabase secrets set NAME=value` — do not put real values here.
#
# Both send-asset-email and amc-expiry-check send mail through the shared
# mailer (supabase/functions/_shared/mailer.ts), which uses Resend
# (https://resend.com) — an API-based email provider, no SMTP server needed:
#
# RESEND_API_KEY           - from the Resend dashboard (Settings -> API Keys).
#                             Required for either function to actually send;
#                             until set, both just log the email instead.
# MAIL_FROM                - the From address, e.g. "KOTU Asset Tracker
#                             <notifications@yourdomain.com>". The domain part
#                             must be a domain verified in Resend (Domains tab)
#                             or delivery will fail/land in spam.
# AMC_NOTIFICATION_EMAIL   - the team inbox that receives the consolidated AMC
#                             expiry report. Required for amc-expiry-check to
#                             send anything.
RESEND_API_KEY=
MAIL_FROM=
AMC_NOTIFICATION_EMAIL=
